{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a new adventure of Blop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a peaceful walk through the forest, blop find a monolith. After touching he was teleported in the dungeon. His goal is to find the way out, yours \u2014 is to help him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Monolith:</strong><br>Find pieces of the monolith to restore its structure. The monolith reacts to the player\u2019s actions and teleport the slime to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/monolith.gif?t=1749058629\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Potion Brewing:</strong><br>Combine ingredients and experiment with different recipes to craft potions for solving puzzles and interacting with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/brewing.gif?t=1749058629\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Restart:</strong> <br>If something goes wrong, use the restart potion to reset the current level and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/restart.gif?t=1749058629\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731450?t=1749058629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731450?t=1749058629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/f080492dd81cd70b9c3fea098d3acdd2d26f06b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749058629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/f080492dd81cd70b9c3fea098d3acdd2d26f